  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership for Climate, Renewable Energy and Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This partnership which is also known as KINETIK will deepen bilateral cooperation on reducing emissions and promoting clean energy to accelerate the net zero transition. The partnership will focus on three mutually reinforcing pillars: &#x2022; encouraging increased investment in the energy transition by supporting Indonesia-led policy and regulatory reform through our existing bilateral economic governance program, Prospera &#x2022; unlocking finance in climate-focused small and medium-sized enterprises through Australian Development Investments (ADI) and incentivising investment in larger scale green infrastructure projects through the Private Infrastructure Development Group (PIDG) &#x2022; promoting a just transition in which women, people with disabilities and the marginalised participate in and benefit from the shift to net zero.</narrative>
  </description>
